< +DATA
< F LEVEL ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL LOC_ID LOC_NAME
< R 1 8 PART "" P8 0 ""
< R 2 9 PART "" P9 0 ""
< K ERROR=500
< .
@ROOM 0
> ASSY PATH 23
< +DATA
< F LEVEL ITEM_ID CATEGORY MFR MODEL LOC_ID LOC_NAME
< R 1 8 PART "" P8 0 ""
< R 2 9 PART "" P9 0 ""
< R 3 10 PART "" P10 0 ""
